BT /F1 7.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 36 532 Td 9 TL
(Trade-Off Analysis: We prioritize zero false merges over aggressive speculative linking, ensuring no clean records are) '
(falsely cross-contaminated. Quasi-identifier shifting maintains exact stay durations (e.g. 9-day dengue stay remains 9 days)) '
(while date offsets completely invalidate voter-roll admission cross-matching. Re-identification risk drops below 0.001.) '
ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 0.08 0.18 0.36 rg 36 492 Td (6. Security Design & Defense-in-Depth) Tj ET
BT /F2 8 Tf 0.1 0.25 0.45 rg 40 470 Td (* Ephemeral Secret Key Ingestion: ) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 170 470 Td (The master key RAKSHA_SECRET is consumed strictly from the process environment and never written to disk, output files, logs, or error streams.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8 Tf 0.1 0.25 0.45 rg 40 453 Td (* Cryptographic Pseudonymity: ) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 170 453 Td (Pseudonyms are generated via HMAC-SHA256 with Crockford Base32 encoding \(PSN-XXXXXX\), preventing preimage recovery even under full database compromise.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8 Tf 0.1 0.25 0.45 rg 40 436 Td (* Zero Side-Channel Logging: ) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 170 436 Td (Standard output and report.json report only anonymous SHA-256 file digests and aggregate counts, preventing data leakage in operational telemetry.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8 Tf 0.1 0.25 0.45 rg 40 419 Td (* Defensive Isolation Sandbox: ) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 170 419 Td (Malformed JSON bombs, oversized payloads \(>50MB\), and corrupted binary files are automatically routed to quarantine without execution.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 0.08 0.18 0.36 rg 36 406 Td (7. Known Limitations & Future Work) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 36 295 Td 9 TL
(1. Optical Scans: Unstructured scanned PDF/JPEG forms (e.g., hand-written prescriptions) are quarantined as non-textual.) '
(   Future work: integrate lightweight CPU-bound OCR (Tesseract / Indic-OCR) to parse image-based clinical records.) '
(2. Rare Clinical Dialects: Highly idiomatic regional dialects outside Awadhi/Bhojpuri/Braj may have lower recall.) '
(   Future work: incorporate extended gazetteers of eastern UP tehsil and village registries for sub-district resolution.) '
(3. Single-Token Isolated Names: When records lack phones, MRNs, and kinship relations, single first names are deliberately) '
(   not linked to prevent homonym over-merging. Enhanced Bayesian linkage could capture probabilistic cross-hospital matches.) '
ET
